        "id": "paper:theorem:s-cobordism",
        "entryClass": "claim",
        "claimKind": "theorem",
        "displayLabel": "定理 · 1 · $s$-余边界定理",
        "shortTitle": "$s$-余边界定理",
        "title": "$s$-余边界定理",
        "statement": "若闭、连通、定向的 $m$-流形 $M_0,M_1$ 是 $(m+1)$-流形 $W$ 的边界分支，且 $W$ 与 $M_0\\times[0,1]$ 具有相同的简单同伦型，则当 $m>4$，$W\\cong M_0\\times[0,1]$；当 $m=4$ 且基本群良好时同样成立。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=1",
        "sourceReference": "s-cobordism theorem"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:heegaard-diagram",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 1 · Heegaard 图",
        "shortTitle": "Heegaard 图",
        "title": "Heegaard 图",
        "statement": "Heegaard 图是亏格为 $g$ 的曲面 $\\Sigma_g$ 连同两组各含 $g$ 条互不相交嵌入圆的曲线 $\\alpha,\\beta$；每组曲线将 $\\Sigma_g$ 切成一个 $2g$-穿孔球面，并分别界定其对应把手体中的嵌入 $2$-球。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=1"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:trisection",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 2 · 4-流形三分解",
        "shortTitle": "4-流形三分解",
        "title": "4-流形三分解",
        "statement": "光滑、连通、闭、定向 $4$-流形 $X$ 的三分解 $\\tau$ 是分解 $X=X_1\\cup X_2\\cup X_3$，其中每个 $X_i$ 是 $4$ 维把手体，每个 $X_i\\cap X_j$ 是 $3$ 维把手体，且 $X_1\\cap X_2\\cap X_3=\\Sigma_g$。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=1"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:open-book",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 3 · 开书分解",
        "shortTitle": "开书分解",
        "title": "开书分解",
        "statement": "$3$-流形 $Y$ 的开书分解是由纽结（binding）$L\\subset Y$ 及纤维化 $Y-L\\to S^1$ 构成的分解；纤维称为页，且每个页的边界为 $L$。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=2"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:proposition:trisection-gluing",
        "entryClass": "claim",
        "claimKind": "proposition",
        "displayLabel": "命题 · 1 · 开书一致时的三分解粘合",
        "shortTitle": "开书一致时的三分解粘合",
        "title": "开书一致时的三分解粘合",
        "statement": "若两个具有相同边界的三分解 $4$-流形所诱导的开书分解一致，则将它们沿边界粘合所得的闭 $4$-流形具有由这两个三分解粘合而成的三分解。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=2",
        "sourceReference": "Castro, Relative trisections of smooth 4-manifolds with boundary, ref. 8"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:proposition:monodromy-criterion",
        "entryClass": "claim",
        "claimKind": "proposition",
        "displayLabel": "命题 · 2 · 单值性判据",
        "shortTitle": "单值性判据",
        "title": "单值性判据",
        "statement": "若三分解的单值性为 $0$ 或 $1$，则对应的 $4$-流形必为四个基本 $4$-流形之一。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=2",
        "sourceReference": "Kirby and Thompson, A new invariant of 4-manifolds, ref. 6"
      },
      {
        "id": "paper:def:group-trisection",
        "entryClass": "fact",
        "factKind": "definition",
        "displayLabel": "定义 · 4 · 群的三分解",
        "shortTitle": "群的三分解",
        "title": "群的三分解",
        "statement": "对 $4$-流形三分解应用基本群函子得到一个满射立方体：由中心曲面到三个 $3$ 维把手体、由两块并到各 $4$ 维把手体以及到 $\\pi_1(X)$ 的满射组成；该立方体称为群 $G$ 的三分解。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=3"
      },
