        "shortTitle": "群三分解与 $4$-流形的对应",
        "title": "群三分解与 $4$-流形的对应",
        "statement": "任意有限表示群 $G$ 都有群三分解，并且群三分解与光滑、闭、可定向 $4$-流形一一对应。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=3",
        "sourceReference": "Abrams, Gay, and Kirby, Group trisections and smooth 4-manifolds, ref. 10"
