        "shortTitle": "群三分解的函子性",
        "title": "群三分解的函子性",
        "statement": "群三分解与三分解 $4$-流形之间的对应实际上是函子的。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=3",
        "sourceReference": "Klug, Functoriality of group trisections, ref. 11"
      },
