        "title": "桥式三分解位置存在性",
        "statement": "在三分解的 $4$-流形中，任意嵌入曲面都可通过同伦化置于桥式三分解位置。",
        "sourcePath": "kirby-2018-trisections-of-4-manifolds.pdf#page=3",
        "sourceReference": "Meier and Zupan, Bridge trisections of knotted surfaces in 4-manifolds, ref. 12"
